{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sistema Veterinaria API",
    "description": "Colección completa de endpoints para el Sistema de Gestión Veterinaria.\n\n**Total: 172 endpoints en 14 módulos**\n\n## Configuración Inicial\n1. Importa el archivo de environment (Veterinaria_Environment.json)\n2. Ejecuta el endpoint de Login en Auth\n3. El token se guardará automáticamente en las variables de entorno\n4. Todos los demás endpoints usarán el token automáticamente\n\n## Módulos\n- Authentication (7 endpoints)\n- Clientes (12 endpoints)\n- Pacientes (16 endpoints)\n- Citas (18 endpoints)\n- Consultas (14 endpoints)\n- Diagnósticos (11 endpoints)\n- Tratamientos (15 endpoints)\n- Exámenes (20 endpoints)\n- Vacunas (15 endpoints)\n- Historial Clínico (9 endpoints)\n- Facturas (18 endpoints)\n- Usuarios (13 endpoints)\n- Razas (18 endpoints)\n- Tipos de Servicio (8 endpoints)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "veterinaria-api"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{authToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"authToken\", jsonData.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"userId\", jsonData.userId);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"userEmail\", jsonData.email);",
                  "    console.log(\"Token guardado: \" + jsonData.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@veterinaria.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Autenticar usuario y obtener token JWT"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ping",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/ping",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "ping"]
            },
            "description": "Health check del controlador de autenticación"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Cerrar sesión del usuario actual"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"passwordActual\": \"admin123\",\n  \"passwordNueva\": \"newpassword123\",\n  \"confirmarPassword\": \"newpassword123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/cambiar-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "cambiar-password"]
            },
            "description": "Cambiar contraseña del usuario autenticado"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Validar Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/validar",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "validar"]
            },
            "description": "Verificar si el token JWT es válido"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Usuario Actual (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Obtener información del usuario autenticado"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Recuperar Password",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@veterinaria.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/recuperar-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "recuperar-password"]
            },
            "description": "Solicitar recuperación de contraseña (envía email)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
